Please be advised that pursuant to NH RSA 507-H:4, III(d), a controller is strictly not required to authenticate an opt-out request. Furthermore, pursuant to NH RSA 507-H:6, V(a), you may not require me to create a new account to process this directive. In accordance with NH RSA 507-H:6, I(g), you are prohibited from discriminating against me for exercising these statutory rights, including altering the price or quality of goods or services provided.

In accordance with NH RSA 507-H:4, III(a), you are required to comply with this request without undue delay, and in no event later than forty-five (45) days from the receipt of this communication.

If you determine that my data is subject to a statutory exemption under NH RSA 507-H:3, or if you refuse to take action on this request for any reason—including an invocation of the fraud exception under NH RSA 507-H:4, III(d)—you must inform me within the initial 45-day period, state your specific, documented justification, and provide clear instructions on how to initiate an internal appeal pursuant to NH RSA 507-H:4, III(b) and IV.

I request that you confirm receipt of this communication and provide written confirmation once my opt-out request has been fully executed across your internal systems and communicated to any relevant downstream third-party processors.

